cff-version: "1.2.0"
message: If you use this app, please cite it and the works it builds on, listed under references.
type: software
title: iEEG Spikes
abstract: 'Detects interictal epileptiform discharges on every good channel of intracranial EEG with the Janca et al. 2015 (or Barkmeier et al. 2012) detector from epycom and writes the spikes, spike rates per channel and cross-channel spike events, leaving known seizures out.'
authors:
- name: Pennsieve (University of Pennsylvania)
repository-code: https://github.com/pennsieve-apps/processor-ieeg-spikes
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
- ieeg
- seeg
- ecog
- electrophysiology
- epilepsy
- neuroscience
- spike-detection
